{"id":"ccbc16:puzzle:24","answer":"OSTEOLOGY","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>数一下每张图的东西个数，它们会引导你到某个视频博主。在B站就能找到他</p>","text":"数一下每张图的东西个数，它们会引导你到某个视频博主。在B站就能找到他","assetIds":[]},{"number":2,"title":"已经找到了9张图片代表的东西，下一步是？","html":"<p>查看每个视频里用词根拆分的形式教的第一个医学术语，并且对应到下面的表格里。</p>","text":"查看每个视频里用词根拆分的形式教的第一个医学术语，并且对应到下面的表格里。","assetIds":[]},{"number":3,"title":"我知道要用什么，但是不知道1-12的格子里要填什么","html":"<p>主人公的2字母代号。</p>","text":"主人公的2字母代号。","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[{"answer":"CHUBBYEMU","messageHtml":"<p>加油！</p>","messageText":"加油！","extraHtml":"","extraText":"","assetIds":[]}],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>将9张图的物品数量转字母得到<code>CHUBBYEMU</code>，然后注意到物品都可以对应到ChubbyEmu的视频。列举出每个视频中介绍的医学单词和患者名字，可以将名字填入下方表格，提取相应位置的字母并移位后得到<code>STUDY OF BONES</code>，即答案<code>OSTEOLOGY</code>。</p>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数量</th>\n<th>转字母</th>\n<th>物品</th>\n<th>（B站）视频</th>\n<th>患者名字</th>\n<th>视频中(第一个)详细介绍的词</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>C</td>\n<td>熔岩灯</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vr4y1k7QY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>AW</td>\n<td>Hypocalcemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>H</td>\n<td>香蕉</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1R54y1E7vj\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>KC</td>\n<td>Hypoglycemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>U</td>\n<td>水</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV16q4y1K7Un\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>KC</td>\n<td>Hyponatremia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>比特币</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1w54y1V78y\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>CW</td>\n<td>Tachycardia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>B</td>\n<td>维生素软糖</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1e3411279e\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>TJ</td>\n<td>Hypercalcemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>Y</td>\n<td>能量饮料</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1zq4y1f7Yo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>JS</td>\n<td>Hyperglycemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>E</td>\n<td>甘草糖</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1864y1D7Bo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>VP</td>\n<td>Hypokalemia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13</td>\n<td>M</td>\n<td>酱油</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV17P4y1G7YY\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>CG</td>\n<td>Hypernatremia</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>21</td>\n<td>U</td>\n<td>饼干</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1a64y1B7VX\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">链接</a></td>\n<td>MJ</td>\n<td>Bradycardia</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><table>\n<tr>\n<td>血 -emia</td><td colspan=\"2\">高  Hyper- </td><td colspan=\"2\">低  Hypo-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钠 -natr-</td><td>4C</td><td>G</td><td>K</td><td>5C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钾 -kal-</td><td colspan=\"2\"></td><td>1V</td><td>9P</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钙 -calc-</td><td>2T</td><td>J</td><td>A</td><td>3W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>糖 -glyc-</td><td>J</td><td>10S</td><td>6K</td><td>11C</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<p><table>\n<tr>\n<td></td><td colspan=\"2\">快 Tachy- </td><td colspan=\"2\">慢 Brady-</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心 -cardia</td><td>7C</td><td>8W</td><td>12M</td><td>J</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n`V-3 T+0 W-2 C+1 C-4 K+4 C+3 W+5 P-1 S-5 C+2 M+6 = STUDY OF BONES = OSTEOLOGY`</p></p>","text":"将9张图的物品数量转字母得到\nCHUBBYEMU\n，然后注意到物品都可以对应到ChubbyEmu的视频。列举出每个视频中介绍的医学单词和患者名字，可以将名字填入下方表格，提取相应位置的字母并移位后得到\nSTUDY OF BONES\n，即答案\nOSTEOLOGY\n。\n\n数量\n\n转字母\n\n物品\n\n（B站）视频\n\n患者名字\n\n视频中(第一个)详细介绍的词\n\n3\n\nC\n\n熔岩灯\n\n链接\n\nAW\n\nHypocalcemia\n\n8\n\nH\n\n香蕉\n\n链接\n\nKC\n\nHypoglycemia\n\n21\n\nU\n\n水\n\n链接\n\nKC\n\nHyponatremia\n\n2\n\nB\n\n比特币\n\n链接\n\nCW\n\nTachycardia\n\n2\n\nB\n\n维生素软糖\n\n链接\n\nTJ\n\nHypercalcemia\n\n25\n\nY\n\n能量饮料\n\n链接\n\nJS\n\nHyperglycemia\n\n5\n\nE\n\n甘草糖\n\n链接\n\nVP\n\nHypokalemia\n\n13\n\nM\n\n酱油\n\n链接\n\nCG\n\nHypernatremia\n\n21\n\nU\n\n饼干\n\n链接\n\nMJ\n\nBradycardia\n\n血 -emia\n高  Hyper-\n低  Hypo-\n\n钠 -natr-\n4C\nG\nK\n5C\n\n钾 -kal-\n1V\n9P\n\n钙 -calc-\n2T\nJ\nA\n3W\n\n糖 -glyc-\nJ\n10S\n6K\n11C\n\n快 Tachy-\n慢 Brady-\n\n心 -cardia\n7C\n8W\n12M\nJ\n\n`V-3 T+0 W-2 C+1 C-4 K+4 C+3 W+5 P-1 S-5 C+2 M+6 = STUDY OF BONES = OSTEOLOGY`","refId":null,"assetIds":[]},"extended":{"html":"<p>成功解开谜题后，量子星云影响的设备恢复正常，同时从中浮现出一张碎纸片。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"fragment\" data-asset-id=\"asset-482f55fecd551703c60c88d8\" src=\"data/assets/static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/853f495cc78e43ada41524162c9375be.webp\"/></p>","text":"成功解开谜题后，量子星云影响的设备恢复正常，同时从中浮现出一张碎纸片。","assetIds":["asset-482f55fecd551703c60c88d8"]},"interactive":{"html":"<style>\n#participant .comp td {\n    height: 30px;\n    width: 30px;\n    border: 1px solid;\n    text-align: center;\n}\n#participant .comp_gray {\n    background-color: gray;\n}\n#participant .comp_empty {\n    border: 0;\n}\n#participant .comp {\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n#participant img {\n  padding: 5px; /* Some padding */\n  width: 150px; /* Set a small width */\n}\n</style>\n<div id=\"participant\">\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/dfb4605608354ea09759e94536861bfe.webp\"></img>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/195f9aa460864eeaa874a02a2cf6f642.webp\"></img>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/6d45777dd0a44efdab914050f7b25991.webp\"></img><br>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/30646c6d50de4746ad48d94295e7d5cb.webp\"></img>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/cb8c6bbbbb9c490e8f0010ac976c3caf.webp\"></img>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4acd19d0d2524becbec885b373af2b06.webp\"></img><br>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/4c4d46847a624a67aa7e6b04777a8a9f.webp\"></img>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/47a57c0e664d4aec884b7a83677c1902.webp\"></img>\n<img src=\"https://static.cipherpuzzles.com/static/images/b46fc4fd77c04837a